    "id": "purifier_choice_modify",
    "type": "narrative",
    "text": "You commit to the modification: a secondary exchange loop that catches the isolated compounds before they reach the drainage network, sealed in a vessel Elara can empty on a schedule.\r\n\r\nThe method is the variable. A sanctioned Tier 2 block can carry part of the load and keep your body from doing all the accounting. Without it, the same geometry still works—it simply charges a different account.\r\n\r\nElara sets the lamp where you need it. 'Then we do it properly,' she says. 'Or we do not do it at all.'",
