  "staging_observation": {
    "id": "staging_observation",
    "type": "narrative",
    "text": "You stay outside the fence. From here, with a Scholar's trained eye and a diagnostic plate pressed against the nearest alchemical conduit for passive resonance reading, you can see enough.\r\n\r\nThe scale is the thing. Not the individual crates or the specific materials—you've already documented those from Senna's manifests—but the sheer physical volume of resources concentrated in one place for one purpose. The staging area covers roughly two acres. Every square foot of it is occupied by materials in transit, organized with the ruthless efficiency of a system that has been optimized for exactly one thing: moving resources upward.\r\n\r\nYou count transport vehicles. Eighteen, currently loaded or loading. You estimate tonnage from the vehicle suspension compression—a trick your field instructor taught you, and one of the few things from the Academy that turns out to be consistently useful. The number you arrive at is larger than the annual maintenance allocation for the entire Karet Bay district.\r\n\r\nYou write it all down. Vehicle counts. Estimated tonnage. The routing codes visible on the nearest crate rows. The guard rotation pattern, because you're a Scholar and pattern recognition is what you do, even when the pattern is just two men walking back and forth.\r\n\r\nFrom here, you can see the transit rail construction on the upper terrace. The skeleton of the railway rises against the sky, gleaming with new alloy and fresh alchemical bonds. It is, you have to admit, an impressive piece of engineering. It is being built well, with good materials, by competent people.\r\n\r\nIt is being built with the bones of four districts' infrastructure. And from up there, you probably can't even see Karet Bay.",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "c_so_1",
        "label": "Return to the district with your observations.",
        "mechanic": {
          "type": "navigate",
          "nextNodeId": "warehouse_outro_dispatch"
        },
        "onSelect": [
          {
            "action": "add_item",
            "itemId": "supply_ledger",
            "qty": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
